WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.290
Here is a candle,
standing on a balance.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.210
As it burns, the candle
slowly gets shorter,

3
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:10.130
and the reading on the
balance goes down, and down.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.370
The candle is getting lighter.

5
00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.350
So what is happening to the mass?

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.230
Is the flame destroying it?

7
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.050
Can mass simply vanish into nothing?

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.390
In this mission, you'll zoom in
on a reaction and watch what

9
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.790
the atoms do.

10
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.270
You'll meet reactants and products.

11
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.410
You'll write word equations,

12
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:31.530
and symbol equations that
count every single atom.

13
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.950
Your mission: find out whether
mass is destroyed when a candle

14
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.090
burns.
